          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="97a6-bd65-3d58-17e9">REPEATABLE. Use when a Friendly Unit Within 4&quot; of a Friendly Dark Swarm token is selected as the target of an attack. If this Unit is Within 4&apos;&apos; of the same token, the Targeted Friendly Unit is eligible to make an Evade Roll against that attack. If the targeted Unit is a Size 1, it gains a +1 Modifier to this Evade Roll.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Cost" typeId="06d2-1c49-1cfc-44f5">Reaction (1 BM)</characteristic>
