          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="616e-c7be-abff-a2bf">Target an Enemy Unit Within 8&quot;. The targeted Unit gains the INFESTATION Status. For the purposes of resolving Special Abilities, this effect is treated as a DEBUFF.</characteristic>
