          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="616e-c7be-abff-a2bf">Treat the Supply characteristic of any Enemy Unit that has the INFESTATION Status and is Within 6&quot; as reduced by 1 (to a minimum of 0) for Controlling and Contesting Mission Markers, and completing objectives.</characteristic>
