            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1c06-5502-fb5a-616e">Target an Enemy Unit Within 8&quot;. The targeted Unit gains the INFESTATION Status. For the purposes of resolving Special Abilities, this effect is treated as a DEBUFF.</characteristic>
