          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1c06-5502-fb5a-616e">Target an Enemy Unit Within 8&quot; that has the INFESTATION Status. That Unit counts as Activated in this Phase (set an Activation Marker next to it) and remove the INFESTATION Status from that Unit. You may target any Non-Unique Infested Friendly Unit that is Within 8&quot; of the previously targeted Enemy Unit. Remove the Activation Marker from that targeted Friendly Unit.</characteristic>
