          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="97a6-bd65-3d58-17e9">Each Enemy Unit with the INFESTATION Status on the Battlefield suffers Damage (2). Immediately after this Special Ability is resolved, Remove the INFESTATION Status from Units that suffered Damage.</characteristic>
