            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="616e-c7be-abff-a2bf">While an Enemy Unit has the INFESTATION Status, immediately after its supply is reduced or it is destroyed, target any Friendly Biological Unit Within 12&quot;. This Friendly Unit resolves the HEAL (2) effect.</characteristic>
