          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="616e-c7be-abff-a2bf">During Army Building, you may include Units with the Terran Faction Tag and both Ground and Mechanical Combat Tags in your army. Those Units gain the Infested Combat Tag. Treat any CP cost for those Units&apos; Special Abilities as BM. These Units cannot gain the BURROWED Status.</characteristic>
